{"meta":{"id":"tt8760684","type":"movie","name":"Apolo 11","imdb_id":"tt8760684","description":"El baúl de la NASA se abre para proporcionar material inédito sobre la misión \"Apollo 11\", que llevaría por primera vez al hombre a la Luna. Las cámaras ubicadas en Cabo Cañaveral capturan los momentos más importantes del despegue de la nave. Unidas a las escenas filmadas en el interior del cohete espacial, ambas perspectivas ofrecen una visión íntima sobre las sensaciones que experimentaron los astronautas durante su misión.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt8760684.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/el4j0LHk56uH6ErE5FZu2x5UJx8.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rRs8UeGNS4HwsuR99D7e0FEo9Kf.png","genres":["Documental","Historia","Drama"],"releaseInfo":"2019","released":"2019-03-01T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"90 min","imdbRating":"8.1","country":"United States of America","cast":["Neil Armstrong","Buzz Aldrin","Michael Collins","Walter Cronkite","Bruce McCandless II","Charlie Duke","Andy Aldrin","Patricia Mary Finnegan","Janet Armstrong","John F. Kennedy","Jim Lovell","Gene Kranz","H. David Reed","Clifford E. Charlesworth","Deke Slayton","Bill Anders"],"director":["Todd Douglas Miller"],"trailers":[{"source":"XcIFgM79a0o","type":"Trailer","name":"Apollo 11 - Official Trailer Canada","ytId":"XcIFgM79a0o","lang":"en"},{"source":"PSS8AtjvAcY","type":"Trailer","name":"Apollo 11 (2019) | Official IMAX® Trailer | Exclusively in IMAX Theatres March 1","ytId":"PSS8AtjvAcY","lang":"en"},{"source":"3Co8Z8BQgWc","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer","ytId":"3Co8Z8BQgWc","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"XcIFgM79a0o","title":"Apollo 11 - Official Trailer Canada"},{"ytId":"PSS8AtjvAcY","title":"Apollo 11 (2019) | Official IMAX® Trailer | Exclusively in IMAX Theatres March 1"},{"ytId":"3Co8Z8BQgWc","title":"Official Trailer"}],"links":[{"name":"8.1","category":"imdb","url